# Vercel serves ONLY the static frontend. Everything below is either the
# backend (which runs on EC2, not here) or internal engineering material.
#
# This is the same class of exposure the production-completeness audit found
# and closed in nginx: a static host handed the whole repo will happily serve
# backend source, SQL migrations and internal docs to anyone who guesses the
# path. Vercel needs its own denylist because .gitignore does not apply here —
# these files ARE committed, they simply must not be published.

backend/
test/
uploads/
.claude/

# Internal engineering documents — not user-facing pages.
*.md
DLT Readiness Audit.dc.html
DLT Second Audit.dc.html
DLT Final Verification.dc.html
store-tests.html
dlt-store.js

# Local dev tooling
devserve.mjs
